# Matcha Engine — sample pose lineup.
# After deploying sprites, click through each pose (one sprite at a time).
# Starter placeholders work before you generate; run matcha character to replace them.

label start:
    scene black

    show sakura idle at center
    sakura "Idle pose — starter Placeholder until you generate real sprites."

    show sakura happy
    sakura "Happy pose."

    show sakura sad
    sakura "Sad pose."

    show sakura surprised
    sakura "Surprised pose."

    "End of matcha sprite lineup. Quit from the menu when done."
    return
